            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "clg"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is almost exactly like my recipe, except I use the lime juice of one or two limes--to taste. To make it less labor intensive, I now use my mini-food processor rather than individually chopping the items.",
