              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Castiel_Angel75"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very good recipe if you take out the celery and change out the jalapeno peppers for habanero peppers. ***Make sure to add some of the seeds from the pepper to the salsa or you will not get any of the spice*** Most of the spice comes from the seeds and not the pepper. That also works for the jalapeno peppers as well.",
